ity is  national security this president has  talked about it for many years it helped  him get elected I one of the tweets  during the pipe bomb mailings that the  president sent out was that it was  turning the page that it was essentially  slowing the momentum of Republicans at  that moment is that what he's seeing now  is that the momentum was slowed well the  president sends many tweets on many  different topics so I think we need to  take the totality of the tweets and the  totality of his presidency while he was  sending her about the time he was  sending that tweet within a day or so he  also had an unbelievable event here in  the East Room with black Americans and  they came from all across the country to  say that we are not all Democrats we  support the President's agenda and he's  welcomed us into the people's home into  his home in the residence and that got  very little coverage and the coverage  ikot was then being demeaned and derided  by others and he's sticking up for them  as well so this president does not see  the momentum slowdown insofar as he's  out there running through the tape  leaving it all on the field like you did  in 2016 he will do have done a record  number of presidential visits between  Labor Day and Election Day for any  sitting president President Obama was  acting president george w bush was  active but this president will have had  more events than they did okay I would  appreciate your time thank you Brett

